Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Erebine
Source: https://github.com/Erebine/binaries
Comment: The packages built from this source ship the prebuilt erectl,
 erebine-eim-agent and erebine-eem-agent binaries. Each binary statically
 links the Swift packages listed below. Their source is not part of this
 package; the Files patterns under third_party/ name each package and
 its vendored C code, and each Comment gives the upstream URL, the
 version and git revision linked, and which binaries link it.
 .
 The Swift standard library and core libraries are linked statically
 (--static-swift-stdlib); they are distributed by the Swift project
 under Apache-2.0 with the Swift Runtime Library Exception.
 .
 The NOTICE files of the Apache-2.0 packages are reproduced in
 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES, installed next to this file.

